{"type":"message","id":"da41c8a0","parentId":"e79d8814","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:13:36.242Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f2809a8c-0682-4f60-b450-f82988416093 每日AI资讯搜索] 执行AI资讯搜索任务：\n1. 搜索AI Agent最新产品动态（OpenAI、Anthropic、阿里Qwen、MiniMax等）\n2. 搜索OpenClaw最新功能\n3. 搜索多Agent协作最新技术\n4. 提炼2条最重要信息\n5. 更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\n\n目标：保持对AI领域动态的持续关注\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 - 6:13 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-08 22:13 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775686416116}}
{"type":"message","id":"8704a562","parentId":"da41c8a0","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:13:48.869Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求执行每日AI资讯搜索任务，需要：\n1. 搜索AI Agent最新产品动态\n2. 搜索OpenClaw最新功能\n3. 搜索多Agent协作最新技术\n4. 提炼2条最重要信息\n5. 更新到memory/2026-04-07.md（但当前是4月9日，应该是4月9日的文件）\n\n让我开始搜索相关内容。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行AI资讯搜索任务，并行搜索多个方向的最新动态。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qsc2eq81pqmk_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"query":"AI Agent OpenAI Anthropic 阿里巴巴Qwen MiniMax 最新产品动态 2026"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qsc2eq81pqmk_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"query":"OpenClaw AI agent framework 最新功能更新 2026"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qsc2eq81pqmk_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"query":"Multi-agent collaboration AI 多智能体协作 最新技术进展 2026"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":35717,"output":234,"cacheRead":891,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36842,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775686416363,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b4e84a2a-5fd0-4e6b-ac77-d1f99622d031"}}
