{"type":"message","id":"9c72ca47","parentId":"231772d4","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:14:05.592Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kxn9d5s4p30a_3","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"智能体航海家:2026 企业级“多智能体协作网络 (MAS)”的数字化远征-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1707558\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"工具调用总线 (Tool-Use Bus) —— 船队的“自动化机械”\\nAgent 不再仅限于文字产出，而是通过标准化 API 总线接管 ERP、CRM 和生产系统。这种从“建议者”到“执行者”的身份转变，是 2026 年数字化远征获得实质收益的关键。\\n冲突解决与审计节点 (Review \\u0026 Conflict Resolution) —— 船队的“督导员”\\n当营销 Agent 追求曝光量而...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Gartner’s 2026 Multi-Agent Systems Boom: Why Enterprises Need Unified Infrastructure to Make Agentic AI Work\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.webanditnews.com/2026/03/31/gartners-2026-multi-agent-systems-boom-why-enterprises-need-unified-infrastructure-to-make-agentic-ai-work/\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"gartner ’s 2026 multi - agent systems boom : why enterprises need unified infrastructure to make agentic ai work 1 comment / by web \\u0026 it news editor / march 31 , 2026 2026 marks a pivotal shift ...\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Multi-Agent Systems for Business: How Teams of AI Agents Outperform Solo Bots\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.aimagicx.com/blog/multi-agent-systems-business-guide-2026\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"Instead of one overloaded bot, you deploy a team of specialized agents that collaborate, delegate, and check each other's work. McKinsey's 2026 AI Impact Report found that multi-agent workflows outperform single-agent setups by 3-5x on complex business tasks—measured by accuracy, speed, and output quality.\\nThree trends to watch in 2026:\\nStandardized agent protocols: Frameworks like Google's Agent-to-Agent (A2...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Multi-Agent Systems: Architecture, Challenges, and Enterprise Adoption (2026 Guide)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.trantorinc.com/blog/multi-agent-systems\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"This is where Multi-Agent Systems come in.\\nInstead of relying on one centralized intelligence, MAS distributes intelligence across multiple autonomous agents, each with a specific role, goal, or expertise. These agents collaborate, negotiate, and coordinate to solve problems that would be inefficient—or impossible—for a single system to handle alone.\\nA Multi-Agent System is a system composed of multiple autonomous agents that interact within a shared environment to achieve individual or collective goals.\\nEach agent typically has:\\nAut...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open-Source AI Agents: Revolutionizing Automation Through Multi-Agent Teamwork in 2026\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.blog.brightcoding.dev/2026/01/08/open-source-ai-agents-revolutionizing-automation-through-multi-agent-teamwork-in-2026/?amp=1\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"Open-Source AI Agents: Revolutionizing Automation Through Multi-Agent Teamwork in 2026\\nMohamed IDBRAHIM\\nil y a 5 joursDiscover how open-source AI agents are transforming automation with collaborative intelligence. This comprehensive guide reveals top frameworks, real-world case studies, safety protocols, and step-by-step implementation strategies for building autonomous agent teams that tackle complex tasks 10x faster.\\nThe Rise of Collaborative AI Agent Ecosystems\\nThe automation landscape shifted radically...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Multiagent AI 2026 Full Guide\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.emergingtechdaily.com/post/multiagent-ai-2026-full-guide\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"Quick Answer\\nMultiagent systems 2026: Networks of specialized AI agents (planner/executor/critic) collaborating via message passing to handle complex workflows end-to-end. Replaces support/sales/marketing depts (50% tasks); LangGraph/AutoGen lead. Gartner: 40% enterprises by EOY; my pilots: 2x output.\\nIn Simple Terms\\nSingle agents chat; multiagent swarms divide labor—researcher...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Agentic AI: The Next Frontier for Enterprise Automation in 2026\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.2sdtechnologies.com/insights/agentic-ai-enterprise-2026\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"A procurement workflow, for instance, spans vendor evaluation, compliance verification, contract negotiation, budget approval, and order placement. No single agent can—or should—handle all of this alone.\\nThis is where multi-agent orchestration becomes essential. In a multi-agent architecture, specialised agents collaborate to complete complex workflows:\\nPlanner agents decompose high-level objectives into executable subtasks and determine sequencing and dependencies.\\nExecutor agents carry out specific actions—querying databases, calling APIs, generating documents, or...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Shift to Multi‑Agent Ecosystems: Why Claude 4.6 and “Agent Teams” Are Replacing the Single Chatbot in 2026\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.trendflash.net/posts/the-shift-to-multiagent-ecosystems-why-claude-46-and-agent-teams-are-replacing-the-single-chatbot-in-2026\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"The real action has moved to multi‑agent ecosystems—systems where coordinated AI “teammates” work in parallel on different parts of a problem, share context, and hand results back to humans and each other.\\nAnthropic’s latest release, Claude Opus 4.6, is one of the clearest signals of this shift. It ships with a 1‑million‑token context window (beta) and native support for Agent Teams, where multiple Claude instances collaborate under an orchestr...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"What Are AI Agents?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.generative.inc/what-are-ai-agents\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"By end of 2026, 40% of enterprise applications will integrate AI agents, up from less than 5% in 2025. Gartner forecasts that by 2028, one-third of enterprise software will include autonomous agents, automating 20% of digital interactions.\\nExpanding Autonomy\\nAI agents are projected to automate 15-50% of business tasks by 2027. As reliability improves and task...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI Agents Explained (2026): What They Are \\u0026 Why\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.meritforgeai.com/guides/ai-agents-guide/\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"Unlike traditional automation (if X happens, do Y), workflow agents can handle exceptions, make judgment calls, and adapt to unexpected inputs. One agent researches, another writes, a third reviews — mimicking a human team. Frameworks like CrewAI and AutoGen are specifically designed for this pattern. Multi-agent systems are still early but showing strong results for complex workflows like content production, software development, and data analysis pipelines.\\nStandardized protocols will win. Open standards like MCP (Model Context...\\n\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1565,"aggregated":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"智能体航海家:2026 企业级“多智能体协作网络 (MAS)”的数字化远征-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1707558\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"工具调用总线 (Tool-Use Bus) —— 船队的“自动化机械”\\nAgent 不再仅限于文字产出，而是通过标准化 API 总线接管 ERP、CRM 和生产系统。这种从“建议者”到“执行者”的身份转变，是 2026 年数字化远征获得实质收益的关键。\\n冲突解决与审计节点 (Review \\u0026 Conflict Resolution) —— 船队的“督导员”\\n当营销 Agent 追求曝光量而...\\n\"\n    